# Versioning (Changesets)

When the change includes library or publishable code, add a changeset as described in `DEPLOYMENT.md`:

- There must be a new or updated file under `.changeset/*.md`.
- Run `npm run changeset`, choose `patch` / `minor` / `major` (or `none` for docs-only / non-release work), add a summary, and commit the generated file with the change.

Docs-only or CI/config work may use bump type `none`. Any user-facing library change needs a real bump type and a committed changeset file.
